      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Quiver Maker",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't sell ordinary arrows. These are artisan arrows that can only be purchased here. Would you really recognize its worth, right?",
      "translation" : "我不賣普通箭矢。這些是隻有在這裡才能買到的工匠特製箭矢。你真的懂得欣賞它們的價值嗎？"
